;; store — a Postgres driver and data-mapping layer for Brood.
;;
;; "Like Ecto, a bit better": the query layer is plain data (no macro DSL, no pin
;; operator), the wire driver is pure Brood over net/tcp's binary mode (no libpq),
;; and LISTEN/NOTIFY is mailbox-native. This is the spike: connect → SCRAM auth →
;; simple query → decoded rows. Layers on top (schema, changeset, repo) come next.
(project
  :name "store"
  :version "0.1.0")
